1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:01,280
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:03,892
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,892 --> 00:00:04,920
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,040
=Episode 9=

5
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:10,839
Welcome home, sir.

6
00:00:18,199 --> 00:00:19,519
Stay home and rest for a few days.

7
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:21,039
I've arranged time off for you.

8
00:00:21,719 --> 00:00:22,359
I'll stay with you.

9
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:24,679
Don't you have work?

10
00:00:25,079 --> 00:00:26,640
I've brought it all home.

11
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:28,280
I'll take my meetings online.

12
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:33,119
You don't have to stay with me.

13
00:00:33,719 --> 00:00:34,479
We're married.

14
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:36,240
Taking care of you

15
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,240
is my job as your husband.

16
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:43,039
Let's go.

17
00:01:10,040 --> 00:01:10,560
Can't sleep?

18
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:13,840
You too?

19
00:01:15,599 --> 00:01:16,280
I'm used to it.

20
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:17,920
Do you often have trouble sleeping?

21
00:01:19,879 --> 00:01:21,120
Back in Africa,

22
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:23,159
it wasn't safe.

23
00:01:23,519 --> 00:01:25,159
Sleeping too soundly was dangerous.

24
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:26,719
After I came back,

25
00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:28,439
I couldn't break the habit.

26
00:01:29,480 --> 00:01:31,239
What do you do when you can't sleep?

27
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:33,799
Send emails.

28
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:36,280
Read.

29
00:01:37,040 --> 00:01:37,560
Sometimes

30
00:01:38,480 --> 00:01:39,519
I sit in the garden for a while.

31
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:44,480
Alone?

32
00:01:48,439 --> 00:01:49,079
I used to.

33
00:01:59,599 --> 00:02:00,280
I added honey.

34
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:07,079
You even know I like honey in my milk?

35
00:02:09,199 --> 00:02:09,800
Bao'er told me.

36
00:02:18,879 --> 00:02:19,960
You know, Mr. Xie,

37
00:02:20,919 --> 00:02:23,719
every time you say that,

38
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:26,960
your ears turn red.

39
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:29,120
Do they?

40
00:02:32,479 --> 00:02:33,599
I never knew

41
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:36,240
you had trouble admitting things, too.

42
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:58,760
♪Every second I spend close to you♪

43
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:01,600
♪My heartbeat quietly slows♪

44
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:03,320
♪The tenderness in your eyes♪

45
00:03:03,480 --> 00:03:06,680
♪Is as romantic as the moon♪

46
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:08,800
♪I don't want to step back again♪

47
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:11,040
♪I want a future by your side♪

48
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:12,520
♪Closer to you♪

49
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:14,760
♪Like spring blooming in my arms♪

50
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:17,040
♪Every little secret of mine♪

51
00:03:17,320 --> 00:03:18,319
♪I want to tell you, one by one♪

52
00:03:18,319 --> 00:03:19,159
Thank you.

53
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,480
♪I like you♪

54
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:22,840
♪Even silence turns sweet♪

55
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:24,440
♪If my heart had an orbit♪

56
00:03:24,719 --> 00:03:25,520
Mr. Xie,

57
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:29,240
why are you so good to me?

58
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:31,520
Sometimes you don't need a reason

59
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:33,719
to be good to someone.

60
00:03:35,040 --> 00:03:38,120
♪You'll always be my favorite♪

61
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:39,560
Then please don't do this anymore.

62
00:03:40,199 --> 00:03:40,680
Why?

63
00:03:43,879 --> 00:03:44,840
Because I'll take it seriously.

64
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:46,400
Then take it seriously.

65
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,920
♪I want to get a little closer♪

66
00:04:01,040 --> 00:04:02,440
♪A little closer still♪

67
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:04,800
♪Hear her breathing♪

68
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:09,840
I...

69
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:11,039
There's something else I wanted to say.

70
00:04:13,599 --> 00:04:16,439
S&D replied to my email.

71
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:18,759
I have an interview next Monday.

72
00:04:19,279 --> 00:04:20,399
If I pass,

73
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:22,000
I can start after graduation.

74
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:25,519
You really love architecture.

75
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:28,040
My dad used to say

76
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:31,839
buildings aren't just cold steel
and concrete.

77
00:04:32,519 --> 00:04:35,199
They're art that holds people's lives.

78
00:04:36,279 --> 00:04:38,639
I think buildings have warmth.

79
00:04:38,959 --> 00:04:39,759
So when I design one,

80
00:04:40,079 --> 00:04:42,360
I start with its context and warmth.

81
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:48,600
When Xie Jingshu founded S&D,

82
00:04:48,759 --> 00:04:49,759
she said something similar.

83
00:04:51,959 --> 00:04:52,480
Back then,

84
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:56,279
my parents opposed her opening the firm.

85
00:04:57,759 --> 00:04:58,839
They even

86
00:04:59,399 --> 00:05:00,920
lined up a skyscraper project for her.

87
00:05:02,079 --> 00:05:02,920
But she turned it down

88
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:04,759
and kept only the creative park.

89
00:05:05,319 --> 00:05:06,120
I know about that.

90
00:05:06,439 --> 00:05:08,759
It's why I want to join S&D.

91
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:12,839
She's going to love you.

92
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:18,199
Mr. Xie,

93
00:05:19,519 --> 00:05:21,639
I want to get into S&D on my own.

94
00:05:23,399 --> 00:05:25,079
Please don't pull any strings.

95
00:05:28,399 --> 00:05:28,879
What?

96
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,279
You seem so sure

97
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:33,079
I'd interfere.

98
00:05:33,439 --> 00:05:34,720
I mean,

99
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:38,079
you always take care of others.

100
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:43,399
I...

101
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:45,839
don't want you doing everything for me.

102
00:05:57,079 --> 00:05:57,439
Okay.

103
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:58,720
I won't interfere.

104
00:06:22,200 --> 00:06:23,100
♪You say you♪

105
00:06:23,100 --> 00:06:25,160
♪Don't need anyone♪
(Signature page, Party A Xie Zhouhan)

106
00:06:25,520 --> 00:06:28,560
♪You're just fine on your own♪

107
00:06:28,880 --> 00:06:31,720
♪I see the pride behind your smile♪

108
00:06:31,840 --> 00:06:34,720
♪And the pain you face at night♪

109
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:38,400
♪Sometimes love isn't about possession♪

110
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:41,560
♪It's tenderness that sets you free♪

111
00:06:41,640 --> 00:06:44,640
♪Some love needs no promises♪

112
00:06:44,760 --> 00:06:48,000
♪I'll face this cold world with you♪

113
00:06:48,080 --> 00:06:50,680
♪I keep my feelings safely hidden♪

114
00:06:50,800 --> 00:06:53,920
♪Quietly staying behind you♪

115
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:56,880
♪I'm right behind you♪

116
00:06:57,240 --> 00:07:00,400
♪Shielding you from every hidden storm♪

117
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:03,040
♪Keeping the rain out of your eyes♪

118
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:07,040
♪So you can walk ahead without fear♪

119
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:13,240
♪I'm right behind you♪

120
00:07:13,400 --> 00:07:15,120
♪Waiting for you to turn around♪

121
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:16,960
♪Waiting for you to finally see♪

122
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:19,400
♪You're the only one I lose control for♪

123
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:20,960
♪I'm right behind you♪

124
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:23,320
♪Loving you gently, though no one knows♪

125
00:07:23,440 --> 00:07:25,080
♪I won't claim you♪

126
00:07:25,200 --> 00:07:26,760
♪I won't ask you to stay♪

127
00:07:26,880 --> 00:07:29,440
♪I'll spend the rest of my life♪

128
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:32,800
♪Waiting for you♪
